    {
      "caption": "Adding vectors: tail to head",
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "id": "s2",
      "narration": "To add vectors, put the tail of the second at the head of the first. Vector a goes right and up; vector b continues from where a ends. The sum runs from the very first tail to the very last head.",
